{
  "_comment": [
    "Synthetic $script:ResourceData for the -ExtractLocals golden-file test.",
    "Deliberately repetitive: two resource locations spread across routing domains,",
    "applications and a domain override; two identities reused across several",
    "policies and the session policy. Also carries the cases that MUST NOT be",
    "collapsed, so the literal fallback stays covered:",
    "  ap-everyone         values=[\"Everyone\"], no metadata",
    "  ap-order-mismatch   metadata tokens present but out of order in values[]",
    "  ap-partial          an extra value[] entry no metadata key accounts for",
    "  rd-conflicting-name same uuid reported under two different names",
    "  ap-name-case-a/b   two identities whose display names differ only in case",
    "  ap-hcl-keyword     a display name that sanitises to the HCL keyword `for`",
    "  rd/app DC North    same uuid under a case-only rename -> conflict, stays inline",
    "  sp-empty-token     a token list with an empty member -> stays inline",
    "  ap-tag-sigil        tag_source/tag_key carrying ${ and %{ -> non-list scalar sink",
    "  terminate_*         machine/user fields carrying ${ and %{ -> non-list scalar sinks",
    "  sg-sigil            security-group system/unpublished_app scalars -> non-list sink",
    "  browser_mode        a scalar written straight into optional_fields",
    "  rd orphan           a location referenced exactly once -> below the repeat threshold, stays inline",
    "  rd nameless-a/b     a uuid only routing domains report, but twice -> nameless loc_<uuid> entry",
    "  app-0009            a NAMED location referenced once -> also below the threshold, stays inline"
  ],
